sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Manager as rhods-operator Manager
    participant DSCInit as DSCInitialization<br/>Reconciler
    participant DSC as DataScienceCluster<br/>Reconciler
    participant CompCtrl as Component Controllers<br/>(DSP, Kueue, MR, Ray,<br/>Spark, Trainer, TrainingOp, TrustyAI)
    participant SvcCtrl as Service Controllers<br/>(Auth, Gateway, Monitoring)
    participant APIServer as OpenShift APIServer
    participant ServiceCA as service-ca Operator

    Note over Manager,ServiceCA: Startup Flow

    Manager->>APIServer: Read TLS security profile<br/>GET config.openshift.io/v1/APIServer
    APIServer-->>Manager: TLS profile (min version, cipher suites)
    Manager->>Manager: Configure TLS for webhook<br/>and metrics servers
    ServiceCA->>Webhook: Provision TLS certificate<br/>(opendatahub-operator-controller-webhook-cert)

    Note over Admin,SvcCtrl: Platform Initialization Flow

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create DSCInitialization CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission request<br/>POST /validate-dscinitialization-v1<br/>TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>Admin: CR created
    K8sAPI->>DSCInit: Watch notification<br/>(DSCInitialization created)
    DSCInit->>K8sAPI: Create namespaces, RBAC,<br/>NetworkPolicies, ConfigMaps
    DSCInit->>K8sAPI: Create Auth, GatewayConfig,<br/>Monitoring service CRs

    Note over Admin,SvcCtrl: Component Deployment Flow

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create DataScienceCluster CR<br/>(enable components)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-datasciencecluster-v1<br/>Defaulting webhook (TLS)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Apply defaults
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-datasciencecluster-v1<br/>Validation webhook (TLS)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result
    K8sAPI-->>Admin: CR created
    K8sAPI->>DSC: Watch notification<br/>(DataScienceCluster created)
    DSC->>CompCtrl: Cascade reconciliation<br/>per enabled component
    CompCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/update component CRs<br/>(Deployments, Services, RBAC)
    DSC->>SvcCtrl: Cascade reconciliation<br/>to service controllers

    Note over SvcCtrl,ServiceCA: Gateway Ingress Setup

    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create GatewayClass, Gateway
    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create HTTPRoutes
    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Deploy kube-auth-proxy
    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Check Istio CRDs available?
    K8sAPI-->>SvcCtrl: CRDs present
    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create EnvoyFilter,<br/>DestinationRule (conditional)

    Note over SvcCtrl,ServiceCA: Auth Service Setup

    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch models-as-a-service namespace
    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch kuadrant-system namespace
    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create namespace-scoped<br/>RBAC policies

    Note over Manager,APIServer: TLS Profile Change

    APIServer->>Manager: TLS profile changed
    Manager->>Manager: SecurityProfileWatcher<br/>cancels manager context
    Manager->>Manager: Pod restart to pick up<br/>new TLS settings
